      "summary": "Only the manifest .devai/state/inventory/inventory.json is bound to the generation, by its sha256 and integration_head. The three body files the checker consumes (api-map.json, data-model.json, data-model-pii.json) are only checked for existence with statSync().isFile(). Nothing ties their bytes to this run or to this HEAD/tree.",
